    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not going to upgrade this house for \nthe buyer. We are not going to fix things  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16560,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are cosmetic and ridiculous and that the \nbuyer can get in there and do themselves. And  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21440,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is another way that you put yourself in the \nposition to have the leverage to say that. Okay?  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28000,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you've get multiple offers, then the person \nwhose offer you accept, they know that there  "
