  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38000,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're going to be a lot more conservative with \nthe things that they ask for. Why? Because they  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42880,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't have the leverage. And you, my seller \nfriend, will not be doing all those repairs.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49200,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
